### Course Registration Service API Tests

### 1. Register a student for a class with multiple subjects
POST https://localhost:7293/api/studentregistration/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": 1,
  "classId": 1,
  "subjectIds": [1, 2, 3],
  "indexNumber": "STU001"
}

### 2. Get all registrations for a specific student
GET https://localhost:7293/api/studentregistration/student/1
Accept: application/json

### 3. Get all pending registrations (for admins)
GET https://localhost:7293/api/studentregistration/pending
Accept: application/json

### 4. Get a specific registration by ID
GET https://localhost:7293/api/studentregistration/1
Accept: application/json

### 5. Approve a registration (admin action)
POST https://localhost:7293/api/studentregistration/1/approve?adminId=1
Content-Type: application/json

### 6. Reject a registration (admin action)
POST https://localhost:7293/api/studentregistration/2/reject?adminId=1
Content-Type: application/json

"Subject not available for this semester"

### 7. Register another student
POST https://localhost:7293/api/studentregistration/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": 2,
  "classId": 1,
  "subjectIds": [1, 4],
  "indexNumber": "STU002"
}
